-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §27 היקף העסקה של מורה ביישום חלקי של
-- הרפורמה: the most a teacher in part application may be employed at, with
-- all the employers together, comes down year by year — 130% in תשע"ב, 125%
-- in תשע"ג, 110% in תשע"ד — and from תשע"ה §14 applies.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-14`
IMPORT `oz-founding-26`

§ `27 היקף העסקה של מורה ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

-- ¶1 and the table: the greatest position (cumulative, with all the
-- employers together) allowed to a teacher to whom the reform is applied
-- in part (§26's opening) comes down gradually: 130% in תשע"ב, 125% in
-- תשע"ג, 110% in תשע"ד. A greatest position is one he may hold, so the
-- figure itself is in. ¶1 says the reduction runs "עד תשע"ה" and the table
-- stops at תשע"ד: in תשע"ה ¶2's §14 takes over.
--
-- §26's opening brings part ג, §14 with it, to the same teacher, and
-- §14(א) employs him up to 100% only. ¶2 says "למען הסר ספק" that §14
-- applies from תשע"ה, so before it the table is the rule on his greatest
-- position (convention precedence.specific).
@ref akn:art_27/p1 akn:art_27/t1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the most a teacher in part application may be employed at in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y (130%) (125%) (110%)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the position with all the employers, together` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within section 27's greatest position` y m e `the position with all the employers, together` IS
    IF `a teacher in the Oz part application in` y m e
    THEN CONSIDER `the most a teacher in part application may be employed at in` y
         WHEN JUST most THEN JUST (`the position with all the employers, together` AT MOST most)
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    ELSE NOTHING

-- ¶2: from תשע"ה, §14 applies (the reform is then in every school, in
-- full: §5(א)).
@ref akn:art_27/p2
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 27 hands the employment scope to section 14 in` y IF
    y AT LEAST `the school year 5775`

§§ `27 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `within section 27's greatest position` `the school year 5772` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` (130%) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `within section 27's greatest position` `the school year 5773` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` (130%) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `within section 27's greatest position` `the school year 5774` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` (110%) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- in full application, or from תשע"ה, the section does not speak
#ASSERT `within section 27's greatest position` `the school year 5772` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in full` 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `within section 27's greatest position` `the school year 5775` `a teacher teaching on both eves` `the Oz reform in part` 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `section 27 hands the employment scope to section 14 in` `the school year 5775`
-- the table steps down to §14(א)'s full position, which it never goes below
#ASSERT `the most a teacher in part application may be employed at in` `the school year 5774` EQUALS JUST (110%)
#ASSERT NOT `within section 14(א)'s full position` (110%)
